	v_u_77("Hi! I\'m Mobi, your tutorial assistant! I\'ll be teaching you the basics of Studio Mobi.")
	v_u_77("Studio Mobi is a mobile-first development tool for players who do not have access to Roblox Studio.")
	v_u_77("It took 4 months of development before the game was publicly released!")
	v_u_77("Currently, the game has several tools and systems that you might not even notice. Let me show you the essentials!")
